{"rsid":2593,"house":"Rajya Sabha","name":"Shri Devendra Pratap Singh","reviewed_at":"2026-10-29T22:19:46.654Z","sections":{"questions":{"source":"https://rsdoc.nic.in/Question/GetMeber_Question?mpcode=2593","status":"available","total":21,"source_total":21,"records":[{"mp_code":2593,"qslno":328530,"qtitle":"Exchange Programmes","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"13.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-13T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":2910,"name":"Devendra Pratap Singh                   ","min_name":"DEVELOPMENT OF NORTH EASTERN REGION  ","qn_text":"(a) whether the Ministry, in coordination with national integration schemes, has organized student and youth exchange programmes between Chhattisgarh and the North Eastern States;\r\n(b) if so, the details of participation levels and cross-cultural learning achieved under these initiatives;\r\n(c) whether best practices in bamboo crafts and organic farming from the North East are being shared with Chhattisgarh's tribal artisans; and\r\n(d) the details of subsequent livelihood benefits generated?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU2910_5kwdNG.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2910_5kwdNG.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU2910_5kwdNG.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU2910_5kwdNG.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU2910_5kwdNG.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2910_5kwdNG.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2593,"qslno":328280,"qtitle":"PM-KUSUM in Chhattisgarh","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"11.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-11T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":2691,"name":"Devendra Pratap Singh                   ","min_name":"NEW AND RENEWABLE ENERGY","qn_text":"(a) whether the PM-KUSUM scheme has successfully achieved massive solarization of agricultural pumps across Chhattisgarh; \r\n(b) the details of off-grid solar pumps installed for tribal farmers in Financial Year 2025-26; \r\n(c) whether this historic green initiative has eliminated diesel dependency and provided reliable daytime irrigation; and\r\n(d) the resulting boost to crop yields, farmer incomes, and the State's carbon footprint reduction?\r\n\r\nGK","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU2691_K9Gy48.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2691_K9Gy48.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU2691_K9Gy48.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU2691_K9Gy48.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU2691_K9Gy48.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2691_K9Gy48.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2593,"qslno":328022,"qtitle":"Transparent auctions and tribal welfare","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"10.08.2026","adate":"2026-08-10T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":2426,"name":"Devendra Pratap Singh                   ","min_name":"COAL","qn_text":"(a) whether transparent coal block auctions by the Centre have significantly boosted revenue sharing for the State of Chhattisgarh;\r\n(b) if so, the record revenue generated and transferred during the last three years;\r\n(c) whether Government successfully utilized District Mineral Foundation (DMF) funds for inclusive growth in tribal and coal-bearing regions; and\r\n(d) if so, the details of land compensation, rehabilitation, healthcare, education, and drinking water projects measures taken?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":271,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/271/AU2426_mqH1UU.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2426_mqH1UU.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU2426_mqH1UU.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU2426_mqH1UU.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/271/AU2426_mqH1UU.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/271/AU2426_mqH1UU.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2593,"qslno":327793,"qtitl