=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/270/AU447_aaniAg.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU447_aaniAg.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU447_aaniAg.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/270/AU447_aaniAg.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/270/AU447_aaniAg.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2593,"qslno":320562,"qtitle":"Repurposing of mining areas in Chhattisgarh for tourism and recreation","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"02.02.2026","adate":"2026-02-02T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":206,"name":"Devendra Pratap Singh                   ","min_name":"COAL","qn_text":"(a) whether Government has any plan to utilize mining areas in the State of Chhattisgarh, after the exhaustion of coal reserves, for promoting tourism and recreational activities;\r\n(b) if so, the details of proposed initiatives such as eco-parks, sites for water sports, underground tours, golf grounds and avenues for recreation, adventure or bird watching;\r\n(c) the steps being taken to transform such areas in the State of Chhattisgarh into sustainable tourism hubs; and\r\n(d) whether any consultations with stakeholders or pilot projects have been undertaken in the State in this regard?","ans_text":null,"ses_no":270,"depc":0,"status":"Answered  ","P_flag":"Y","files":"https://sansad.in/getFile/annex/270/AU206_Y9GGZ7.pdf?source=pqars","hindifiles":"https://sansad.in/getFile/qhindi/270/AU206_Y9GGZ7.pdf?source=pqars","eng_file_name":"AU206_Y9GGZ7.pdf","hindi_file_name":"AU206_Y9GGZ7.pdf","eng_file_dsp":"/getFile/annex/270/AU206_Y9GGZ7.pdf?source=pqars","hindi_file_dsp":"/getFile/qhindi/270/AU206_Y9GGZ7.pdf?source=pqars","min_code":0,"supp":null},{"mp_code":2593,"qslno":320524,"qtitle":"Introduction of International flights at Swami Vivekananda Airport, Raipur","qtype":"UNSTARRED ","ans_date":"02.02.2026","adate":"2026-02-02T00:00:00","shri":"Shri      ","qno":168,"name":"Devendra Pratap Singh                   ","min_name":"CIVIL AVIATION","qn_text":"(a) whe